1
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,080
Mother, slow down.

3
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,600
Everyone,

4
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,520
please be seated.

5
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:50,560
Come.

6
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:53,720
Today is my mother's 80th birthday.

7
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:55,880
Thank you all for honoring
us with your presence.

8
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:58,520
I, Zhao, am deeply grateful.

9
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,640
Come.

10
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:05,000
Let us drink together.

11
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:06,000
-Come.
-Come.

12
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,960
May her blessings be as
vast as the Eastern Sea.

13
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:10,600
And her life as long as
the Southern Mountains.

14
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,680
Shopkeeper.

15
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:16,040
The Zhao family truly are
great merchants of the capital.

16
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:18,280
Even the appetizers use
premium red bird's nest.

17
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,960
The deposit alone equals
our entire month's revenue.

18
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:25,000
Thank you both for coming to celebrate.

19
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,400
-Congratulations.
-A fine day indeed. Cheers.

20
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:30,720
Wishing you many happy returns.

21
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,920
Cheers.

22
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:39,040
Profit is secondary.

23
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,600
If we pull off today's banquet,

24
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,360
Bofeng Tavern's reputation will...

25
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,120
Mother, it's me! Mother!

26
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,680
Mother!

27
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,040
What are you doing?

28
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,240
Go!

29
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:01,840
Murder!

30
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,360
Someone help me!

31
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,960
You crooked establishment!

32
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,960
What did you feed us?

33
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,240
Shopkeeper!

34
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,760
Zhaocai, seal the doors at once.

35
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,520
Jinbao, fetch a physician.

36
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,280
Everyone else, restrain the crazed guests.

37
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,440
-And don't get hurt.
-Yes.

38
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,520
Yes.

39
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,760
The coroner has confirmed it.

40
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:39,960
All four suffered damage to their organs.

41
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:41,280
Their pupils were clouded and dilated.

42
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:43,160
Classic signs of the Infinity Pill
attacking the heart.

43
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,560
More frighteningly,

44
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:46,120
this poison does not strike suddenly.

45
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,280
It builds up over time,

46
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,440
steadily devouring the mind.

47
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,840
Ling Yunfei again.

48
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:51,840
Since these men moved at the whistle,

49
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:54,160
they were clearly trained
assassins willing to die.

50
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:56,120
Those people who vanished
outside the capital...

51
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:58,680
Could Ling Yunfei have abducted them all?

52
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,800
Your theory is plausible.

53
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:03,520
Now we must find where
Ling Yunfei makes the poison.

54
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,080
Only then can we unravel everything.

55
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:06,800
All four men died violently.

56
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:08,200
Liu Ruyan was silenced too.

57
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,680
We have no leads left.

58
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:11,960
What if we trace the ingredients
of the Infinity Pill?

59
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:14,040
Yinqing, tell us.

60
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:15,960
My lord.

61
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,120
I examined it carefully.

62
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,760
The main ingredient of the Infinity Pill

63
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:19,680
is called Fuqing Grass.

64
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:21,600
Its blossoms are purple and open-faced.

65
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,680
The stamens are clear white,
and the leaves bright green.

66
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,440
They grow staggered along the stem.

67
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:27,280
But it requires a very particular habitat.

68
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,760
It thrives only in warm, damp places.

69
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:33,360
Lord Yin, I had no idea.

70
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,840
You know quite a lot.

71
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:37,480
With so many talents,
why were you never valued before?

72
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,160
Fine horses are common,

73
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,560
but true judges of talent are rare.

74
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:42,560
Then of course you should thank

75
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:45,360
our Lord Meng for recognizing your worth.

76
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,840
So you're the hidden gem.

77
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:50,520
Yinqing, if I didn't know
you were genuinely capable,

78
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,960
I'd seriously suspect

79
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,280
that you joined
the Office of Public Inquiry

80
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:55,040
on the strength of your flattery alone.

81
00:04:57,560 --> 00:05:00,160
Fuqing Grass is hot and potent in nature.

82
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,480
It causes short-term hallucinations.

83
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,560
With prolonged use,

84
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,760
it drives people into madness and stupor.

85
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,240
Even at the sight of a mosquito,

86
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,840
they'd draw a blade and slash at it.

87
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,840
How is that different
from Five-Stone Powder?

88
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:12,480
It's a thousand times more potent.

89
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,160
Addiction sets in very quickly.

90
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:16,120
Besides becoming highly agitated,

91
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:17,760
users gain a sudden burst of strength,

92
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,280
then die as their bodies burn out.

93
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:21,600
If such a deadly poison
reaches the streets,

94
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,680
wouldn't it be lethal to the people?

95
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,040
The danger of this poison...

96
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,920
threatens the safety of the people.

97
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,520
If we let it spread unchecked,

98
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,760
the realm of Daning
itself will be imperiled.

99
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:33,680
A Nian.

100
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:34,600
Do you know of

101
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:36,440
any unusual valley where
Fuqing Grass could grow?

102
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,640
Such a valley would be distinctive,

103
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,520
but Daning is vast.

104
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:42,400
Searching them one by one

105
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,760
would be like finding a needle in the sea.

106
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:45,440
You haven't eaten anything,

107
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,480
so I prepared some pastries.

108
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,680
Our gifted Lady Shen

109
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:50,760
normally never sets foot in the kitchen.

110
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:53,600
-Are these even edible?
-Then do not eat them.

111
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:55,240
-Someone will...
-I love them.

112
00:05:57,120 --> 00:06:00,720
Lord Shen, your tongue is usually
as sweet as honey.

113
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:03,320
Why are you so hard on your own sister?

114
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:04,920
I was wrong.

115
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:07,400
Anything my own sister makes,

116
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,560
how could I possibly call it bad?

117
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:12,520
Even the presentation is
as lovely as a painting.

118
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,280
A painting...

119
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:19,440
Liu Ruyan's painting. Yinqing.

120
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:27,120
Liu Ruyan hid this painting
in a secret compartment.

121
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:28,200
That means the place in it

122
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,640
was not painted at random.

123
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,640
She may actually have been there.

124
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,320
Hibiscus thrives in warm, humid places,

125
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:36,320
just like Fuqing Grass.

126
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,360
Di Nian.

127
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:39,320
Take men and search the outskirts
of the capital at once

128
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,800
for terrain matching this painting.

129
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,840
Lord Meng.

130
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:43,880
Lord Meng!

131
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:45,000
Bofeng Tavern...

132
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,320
Something terrible
happened at Bofeng Tavern!

133
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,440
Stop!

134
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:54,360
-Give me back my husband!
-Stop! What are you doing?

135
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,040
Fuzhi.

136
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,360
Lord Meng.

137
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:59,760
You must seek justice for us!

138
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:01,680
I held the birthday banquet here

139
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:03,920
only out of respect for you.

140
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:06,080
If anything happens to my husband,

141
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,880
how am I supposed to live?

142
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:10,200
Even with you backing her, Lord Meng,

143
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:12,200
Proprietor Yan still
owes us an explanation.

144
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:13,440
Exactly!

145
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:15,360
No one leaves until we get an explanation!

146
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:17,960
-No one leaves!
-No one leaves!

147
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,920
What are you doing?

148
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,320
Stop!

149
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,320
If you want justice,

150
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,800
help me save them.

151
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:28,840
If you want bloodshed,

152
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,520
I will not be merciful.

153
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:33,280
-Save them!
-Save them!

154
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,520
Husband!

155
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,200
My lord.

156
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,120
The wine is poisoned.

157
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,960
Judging by how potent it is,

158
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,560
it is most likely the Infinity Pill.

159
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,120
The Tiger's Roar Gang.

160
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,880
They must be targeting me.

161
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:10,960
These people need treatment immediately,

162
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,160
or their lives are in danger.

163
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:13,520
Where is Lady Yan?

164
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,400
She was just here. How did she vanish?

165
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,920
Lord Meng.

166
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:25,040
Meng Tinghui.

167
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,680
You killed the woman I loved most.

168
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:29,120
I will make the person dearest
to you suffer worse than death.

169
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,720
If you want to save Yan Fuzhi,

170
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,400
come alone as agreed.

171
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:34,440
Otherwise, prepare to collect her body.

172
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:35,920
Fuzhi...

173
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:47,040
Before the evening watch today,

174
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:49,280
if the court does not
hand over Meng Tinghui,

175
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:51,920
I will drench the capital
in blood with Infinity Pills.

176
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,360
Ling Yunfei.

177
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:55,560
Shunzi.

178
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,480
Run!

179
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,920
-Run!
-Run!

180
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,080
Absurd!

181
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:17,440
How dare the Tiger's Roar Gang
be this brazen?

182
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:18,720
Your Majesty, please hear me.

183
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:20,400
The Tiger's Roar Gang must be destroyed,

184
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,760
and Ling Yunfei must be captured.

185
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:23,760
But the people must also be reassured.

186
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,880
I heard that at Bofeng Tavern

187
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,480
many people were poisoned.

188
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:28,600
The capital clinics are
already overflowing,

189
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:31,360
and threatening letters are everywhere.

190
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,240
The whole city is in panic.

191
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:36,440
All of this began because of Meng Tinghui.

192
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:38,120
If we hand over just one person,

193
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,680
we can hold Ling Yunfei at bay

194
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,120
and calm the people.

195
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,840
It is the best course.

196
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,520
Your Majesty, I agree.

197
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:46,520
Meng Tinghui may have
been punishing evildoers,

198
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:47,920
but she also provoked
the Tiger's Roar Gang.

199
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,760
If Your Majesty keeps shielding her,

200
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,880
the people may question
Your Majesty's judgment.

201
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:53,840
Ling Yunfei posted threats
all across the city.

202
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:55,360
Is Meng Tinghui the one he is challenging?

203
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,640
He is challenging me,

204
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,040
and the authority of Daning.

205
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,480
If I retreat today,

206
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,560
that would truly be an unwise act.

207
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:05,600
Your Majesty, all the civil
and military officials

208
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:07,320
are waiting before the main hall.

209
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,520
If Your Majesty still
refuses to hand her over,

210
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,480
it will be hard to convince them.

211
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:12,040
Today, not only Meng Tinghui,

212
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,720
but anyone in this court

213
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:15,040
would never be surrendered by me.

214
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:18,440
Instead of joining forces
to suppress the gang,

215
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:20,920
you two submit a joint
memorial to force my hand.

216
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,120
But, Your Majesty,

217
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,960
less than three hours remain
before the evening watch.

218
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:25,200
If the search fails

219
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,760
and the Tiger's Roar Gang
still holds the Infinity Pills,

220
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,920
the streets of the capital
may be littered with bodies.

221
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,320
How will we answer for that?

222
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:31,640
Your Majesty.

223
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:34,960
Your Majesty, I have a report.

224
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:36,280
Lord Meng requests an audience.

225
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,200
She has also volunteered to go

226
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:40,360
meet Ling Yunfei.

227
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,680
Seal every exit.

228
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:53,120
-Search.
-Yes.

229
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:55,680
Your Majesty.

230
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:58,000
The situation is urgent.
There is no time to lose.

231
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,760
Please allow me to go alone as agreed.

232
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,080
This concerns the dignity of Daning.

233
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,600
This is no time for you to play the hero.

234
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:06,680
I sent Zhishu, Di Nian, and Huang Bo
to hunt Ling Yunfei and his gang citywide.

235
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,160
This matter is not open for discussion.

236
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,520
Ling Yunfei believes

237
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,000
that Liu Ruyan died by my hand.

238
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,560
He wants a life for a life.

239
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:13,840
If my life alone

240
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:16,440
-could save Fuzhi and the whole capital—
-Meng Tinghui!

241
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:18,000
This involves the criminal
underworld of Daning.

242
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:19,640
Do you think this is a game?

243
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:21,960
My decision is final.

244
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:23,720
You may leave.

245
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:25,400
My mind is made up as well.

246
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,720
Even if I die,

247
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,240
I must go.

248
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:38,200
She dared openly defy His Majesty.

249
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:39,600
Lord Meng truly is

250
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:40,760
remarkably bold.

251
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,480
Lord Meng.

252
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,880
My brother has already
gone to find Lady Yan.

253
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:49,280
His Majesty also sent the Divine Guard
to search the capital.

254
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,640
They will surely find Fuzhi.

255
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,400
Why risk your own life?

256
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:57,040
I am going for Fuzhi,

257
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,520
and for the people of the capital.

258
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,720
Ling Yunfei wants me.

259
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,800
It is time I settled this with him.

260
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:04,560
My lord, I know we cannot
talk you out of it.

261
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:05,480
Then how about this?

262
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:07,040
I will go in your place.

263
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,440
I have followed you for so long

264
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:09,960
that your manner and speech

265
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,120
are easy enough for me to imitate.

266
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,440
Ling Yunfei will not recognize me.

267
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:14,360
Can Ling Yunfei not
tell a man from a woman?

268
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:17,280
He specifically ordered me to come alone.

269
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,160
If he sees anyone else,

270
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,520
Fuzhi's life will be in danger.

271
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:22,920
In this game,

272
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,640
we must play by his rules.

273
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:27,080
My lord, if you insist on going,

274
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,360
this soup

275
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:30,120
contains Ten-Tonic Vitality Powder.

276
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,480
Even someone with no inner strength

277
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,800
will become stronger and hardier

278
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,120
and move as swiftly as the wind.

279
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:36,480
You must drink it

280
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:37,400
before we let you leave.

281
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,960
Yes.

282
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:40,200
At least take this medicine

283
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,480
so we can have some peace of mind.

284
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,280
I'm going.

285
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:15,800
You...

286
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:17,040
You drugged me.

287
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:21,440
Forgive us, my lord.

288
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:23,440
It was the only way.

289
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,600
You can sleep soundly
until tomorrow morning.

290
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:33,000
When she wakes,

291
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:35,920
she may punish me or hate
me. I accept it all.

292
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:37,200
I will take men right now

293
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:38,160
to find Lady Yan.

294
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:40,640
I will recheck the clues
from Wanxiang House.

295
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,480
Search carefully, all of you.

296
00:13:58,560 --> 00:13:59,400
-Yes.
-Yes.

297
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,160
Found it.

298
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,400
Your Majesty.

299
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:23,160
Your Majesty, this is the glowstone
powder Lord Meng left behind.

300
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,600
If you insist on going,

301
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:33,000
I will have men protect you in secret.

302
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,840
Ling Yunfei demanded that I come alone.

303
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,720
If he notices anything unusual,

304
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:39,360
-Fuzhi's life...
-This is my final concession.

305
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:47,240
You are an official of Daning.

306
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:49,160
I will never let you face danger alone.

307
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,280
Leave markers along the way.

308
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:53,320
Zhishu and Di Nian will follow in secret

309
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:54,800
without alerting Ling Yunfei.

310
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:56,400
Once I meet Ling Yunfei,

311
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:59,680
I will light a red flame as the signal.

312
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:00,920
Remember.

313
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:01,920
On this mission,

314
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:03,680
your safety and Lady Yan's

315
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:04,960
must come before everything else.

316
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:08,840
Your Majesty.

317
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,520
The forest is dark.
There may be an ambush.

318
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,000
Perhaps Your Majesty should
return to the palace.

319
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,520
We will rescue Lord Meng and Lady Yan.

320
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:15,200
Huang is right.

321
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:16,600
Ling Yunfei is ruthless.

322
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:18,360
-If Your Majesty is harmed...
-All the more reason.

323
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:21,000
I must capture them with my own hands.

324
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:28,560
Come. To the palace.

325
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:29,520
Leyan.

326
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:30,880
Teacher.

327
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,080
Why are you here so late?

328
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,520
Ling Yunfei is devious,

329
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:35,680
and the Office of Public
Inquiry is his first target.

330
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:38,440
I was worried about you.
Are you heading home?

331
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:40,320
I am going to the palace.

332
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:41,240
Leyan.

333
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,760
What is so urgent?

334
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:44,040
Lord Meng is missing.

335
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:45,920
She must have gone alone
to meet Ling Yunfei.

336
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,400
Yinqing already led
the Light Cavalry out of the city.

337
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:48,760
But without anyone to support her,

338
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:50,520
she is in grave danger going alone.

339
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,800
I must report to His Majesty

340
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:52,800
and ask him to send reinforcements.

341
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:54,160
Where are Lieutenant Di

342
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,120
and your brother now?

343
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:56,680
My brother...

344
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:57,960
He already left to find Lady Yan

345
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,480
and track down Ling Yunfei.

346
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:00,680
A Nian

347
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:02,000
may be attending His Majesty.

348
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:03,680
Ling Yunfei

349
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:05,840
will surely spare no one
from the Office of Public Inquiry.

350
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,480
Your brother and Di Nian

351
00:16:07,560 --> 00:16:08,640
are both away from the residence.

352
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,440
Who will protect the Shen household?

353
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:11,960
Deploy the household guards at once

354
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:13,320
and keep the Shen residence
under tight guard.

355
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:14,640
I will go to the palace in your place.

356
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:16,480
But if His Majesty asks for details...

357
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,720
His Majesty knows

358
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:19,080
Lord Meng's temperament very well.

359
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:22,080
I will explain everything properly to him.

360
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:23,160
Do not worry.

361
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:26,080
Take care of yourself and your family.

362
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,360
Lord Meng.

363
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:47,560
Have you not always wanted to capture me?

364
00:16:47,640 --> 00:16:48,720
Enough talk.

365
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:50,760
I am here.

366
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,240
Release Yan Fuzhi.

367
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:54,440
What is the rush?

368
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:57,560
The show has only just begun.

369
00:16:57,640 --> 00:16:58,480
Let me go!

370
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:04,440
Fuzhi!

371
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,760
I have dreamed of you
often these past few days.

372
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,160
In my dreams,

373
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,160
you were just like this,

374
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:18,120
kneeling at my feet and begging for mercy.

375
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:23,840
I truly cannot understand it.

376
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:27,640
You and I stayed out of each other's way.

377
00:17:29,280 --> 00:17:31,480
Why did you insist on hounding me?

378
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:34,320
Everything I built with my own hands

379
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:36,040
was wiped out by you people.

380
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:38,920
And the woman I loved
most died because of you.

381
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,240
Tell me.

382
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:45,280
This blood debt...

383
00:17:45,360 --> 00:17:46,800
How will you repay it?

384
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:48,400
Ling Yunfei.

385
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:52,560
As for how this blood debt is repaid,

386
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:55,200
we will do it your way.

387
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:56,680
But first,

388
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:58,840
release Yan Fuzhi.

389
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:00,600
If you dare touch her,

390
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,960
I will grind your bones to dust.

391
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,960
What touching sisterly devotion.

392
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,760
Have you not been investigating
the Infinity Pills?

393
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,400
Mengmeng!

394
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,320
Let her go!

395
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:29,680
Let her go and come at me instead!

396
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,640
As you wish.

397
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:37,920
Ling Yunfei!

398
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:39,160
Do not hurt Fuzhi.

399
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:41,960
Someone else truly killed Liu Ruyan.

400
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,680
You are taking revenge
on the wrong person.

401
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:45,360
Even if we both die today,

402
00:18:46,320 --> 00:18:48,080
Liu Ruyan in the afterlife

403
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:49,160
will still be unable to rest in peace.

404
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,280
I came here alone today.

405
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:54,800
I am not even afraid to die.

406
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:56,720
Why would I lie to you?

407
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:58,560
That day, I needed Liu Ruyan alive

408
00:18:58,640 --> 00:18:59,760
to learn your whereabouts.

409
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:02,440
Why would I have struck rashly?

410
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:06,920
Even if she did not kill
Sister Ruyan herself,

411
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:08,480
she still drove her to her death.

412
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:10,200
And there is my brother's blood feud,

413
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,120
and the lives of dozens of our brothers.

414
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:15,120
If we do not tear her limb from limb
today,

415
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:16,360
we will have failed Sister Ruyan

416
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:17,640
and our fallen brothers.

417
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:25,760
This should be the place.

418
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:26,800
We are running out of time.

419
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:28,160
Go.

420
00:19:36,520 --> 00:19:38,880
Sir, Ying Gua has led troops
into the Tiger's Roar Gang.

421
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:40,840
We should avoid a direct clash.

422
00:19:45,320 --> 00:19:49,240
Stop! Let her go!

423
00:19:49,320 --> 00:19:50,200
Fuzhi!

424
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:51,960
Let her go!

425
00:19:52,040 --> 00:19:53,320
Do you not want revenge?

426
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:54,400
Come at me!

427
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,680
Stop!

428
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:59,520
Stop feeding her!

429
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,440
Stop!

430
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,080
Let her go!

431
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:07,160
No!

432
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:11,520
No!

433
00:20:11,600 --> 00:20:13,400
Such devoted sisters.

434
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,400
If she wants it so badly, give her more.

435
00:20:17,840 --> 00:20:19,680
I killed Liu Ruyan with my own hands.

436
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:21,880
I killed her myself.

437
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:23,720
It was me.

438
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:25,440
I watched her with my own eyes

439
00:20:25,520 --> 00:20:27,000
die by my hand.

440
00:20:27,080 --> 00:20:30,160
Before she died, she
put on her finest makeup

441
00:20:31,720 --> 00:20:33,240
and wore her most splendid clothes.

442
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:37,600
She waited for you, full of hope.

443
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:39,640
What a pity.

444
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:43,760
You never even saw her one last time.

445
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:53,560
Do you not want to avenge her?

446
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:56,880
Kill me.

447
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:58,560
Kill me right now!

448
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:08,440
Today,

449
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:10,840
I will send you to join Ruyan in death.

450
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:13,640
Ling Yunfei!

451
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:23,640
Fuzhi!

452
00:21:30,800 --> 00:21:32,000
Chief!

453
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:43,680
Raid the Tiger's Roar Gang!

454
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:45,520
-After him!
-Yes!

455
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,080
Fuzhi.

456
00:21:47,640 --> 00:21:48,520
Are you hurt?

457
00:21:49,520 --> 00:21:50,360
I am fine.

458
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:53,600
Fuzhi, what is wrong?

459
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:55,040
They forced her to take an Infinity Pill.

460
00:21:56,880 --> 00:21:57,720
Fuzhi!

461
00:22:02,080 --> 00:22:03,440
As you ordered,

462
00:22:03,520 --> 00:22:04,880
Chief Ling has withdrawn safely.

463
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:10,480
Ling Yunfei is a useful blade.

464
00:22:10,560 --> 00:22:11,680
It would be a waste to lose him.

465
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:14,080
Besides, he knows far too many secrets.

466
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:17,400
Dead or alive,

467
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:20,040
he must never fall into
the hands of the court.

468
00:22:20,600 --> 00:22:21,480
Rest assured, Master.

469
00:22:22,120 --> 00:22:24,000
The court may have raided
the Tiger's Roar Gang,

470
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:25,040
but the secret passage has been destroyed.

471
00:22:25,120 --> 00:22:26,360
For the time being,

472
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:27,720
they will not find his hiding place.

473
00:22:34,080 --> 00:22:35,240
Fuzhi.

474
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:37,040
Fuzhi!

475
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:38,800
Calm down.

476
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:42,560
Stop smashing things, Fuzhi!

477
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:44,760
Fuzhi!

478
00:22:44,840 --> 00:22:45,960
Calm down!

479
00:22:46,520 --> 00:22:47,800
Hold on.

480
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:53,600
Fuzhi!

481
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:56,160
Fuzhi, stop smashing things! Fuzhi!

482
00:22:56,920 --> 00:22:58,000
Stop!

483
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:01,880
Fuzhi!

484
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:07,400
Hold on.

485
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:08,960
Fuzhi!

486
00:23:10,880 --> 00:23:11,720
Fuzhi!

487
00:23:11,800 --> 00:23:13,360
Once you get through
this, you will be all right.

488
00:23:14,800 --> 00:23:16,240
Hold on a little longer, all right?

489
00:23:20,240 --> 00:23:21,480
It is all right.

490
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:36,880
Mengmeng.

491
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:38,680
Give me an Infinity Pill.

492
00:23:39,520 --> 00:23:41,640
Please, give me an Infinity Pill.

493
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:44,560
-I feel awful.
-Fuzhi.

494
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:46,040
Give me an Infinity Pill.

495
00:23:47,320 --> 00:23:49,560
Once you get through
this, you will be all right.

496
00:23:55,560 --> 00:23:57,200
Zhishu.

497
00:23:57,280 --> 00:23:59,240
Give me an Infinity Pill.

498
00:23:59,320 --> 00:24:00,280
Please.

499
00:24:00,360 --> 00:24:01,440
Give me an Infinity Pill.

500
00:24:01,520 --> 00:24:03,800
I feel awful. Give me an Infinity Pill.

501
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:04,720
Please.

502
00:24:04,800 --> 00:24:06,680
Fuzhi, the Infinity Pill will destroy you.

503
00:24:06,760 --> 00:24:08,320
I feel awful.

504
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:09,240
Fuzhi.

505
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:13,760
Wake up!

506
00:24:17,440 --> 00:24:18,800
Fuzhi, let go!

507
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:20,600
Fuzhi, release me!

508
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:22,280
-Stop biting!
-My lord!

509
00:24:22,360 --> 00:24:23,320
-Fuzhi!
-My lord!

510
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:24,920
Tie Lady Yan up first.

511
00:24:25,000 --> 00:24:26,320
She may hurt us when another attack comes.

512
00:24:29,360 --> 00:24:30,360
Let go!

513
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,840
Give me an Infinity Pill!

514
00:24:34,920 --> 00:24:36,160
Or I will kill all of you!

515
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:37,400
Yan Fuzhi!

516
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:40,200
-Put down the knife!
-Fuzhi, do not hurt yourself!

517
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:41,360
Lady Yan!

518
00:24:49,640 --> 00:24:50,560
Lord Shen, quickly!

519
00:24:58,960 --> 00:24:59,800
Let me go!

520
00:24:59,880 --> 00:25:00,760
Lord Meng.

521
00:25:00,840 --> 00:25:03,480
If we do not restrain
her, she may hurt herself too.

522
00:25:11,480 --> 00:25:12,320
Fuzhi.

523
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:14,920
Fuzhi.

524
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:16,280
Fuzhi.

525
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:20,640
Kill me.

526
00:25:21,760 --> 00:25:23,400
It hurts too much.

527
00:25:26,800 --> 00:25:28,480
I cannot bear it.

528
00:25:28,560 --> 00:25:29,840
I am begging you.

529
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:33,840
Kill me.

530
00:25:35,280 --> 00:25:36,480
Kill me!

531
00:25:40,320 --> 00:25:41,400
Fuzhi.

532
00:25:56,160 --> 00:25:57,400
Yinqing.

533
00:25:58,400 --> 00:26:00,200
You have always been skilled with poisons.

534
00:26:06,080 --> 00:26:08,000
Please, save Fuzhi.

535
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:11,920
-My lord...
-Please think of something!

536
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:13,440
Please get up first.

537
00:26:13,520 --> 00:26:17,240
I beg you. Find a way to save her.

538
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:24,840
Fuzhi is my only family.

539
00:26:28,040 --> 00:26:30,320
Even if it costs my life,

540
00:26:31,320 --> 00:26:32,200
I would give it willingly.

541
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:34,760
My lord, please get up.

542
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:36,720
If Lady Yan can be saved,

543
00:26:37,800 --> 00:26:39,040
even if it costs everything I have,

544
00:26:40,120 --> 00:26:41,440
I will not hesitate.

545
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:43,080
My lord.

546
00:26:43,560 --> 00:26:44,480
Lord Shen.

547
00:26:45,520 --> 00:26:46,880
This poison is extraordinarily strange.

548
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:50,280
His Majesty sent Imperial Physician Li
to examine her personally,

549
00:26:50,360 --> 00:26:51,920
but he could do nothing.

550
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:53,480
I searched every medical text

551
00:26:54,360 --> 00:26:55,640
and found no cure.

552
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:57,480
Even if we begin developing an antidote,

553
00:26:58,120 --> 00:26:59,880
it could take months, perhaps years.

554
00:26:59,960 --> 00:27:01,360
But Lady Yan...

555
00:27:05,320 --> 00:27:06,600
may have only three days.

556
00:27:13,040 --> 00:27:14,960
If she can endure this ordeal herself,

557
00:27:15,520 --> 00:27:17,400
the poison will gradually weaken.

558
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:18,600
Three days...

559
00:27:23,600 --> 00:27:24,920
Three days.

560
00:27:43,920 --> 00:27:44,760
Fuzhi.

561
00:27:47,600 --> 00:27:48,440
Fuzhi.

562
00:27:49,920 --> 00:27:50,800
Hold on.

563
00:27:51,760 --> 00:27:54,120
Bofeng Tavern has not
spread across Daning yet.

564
00:27:54,920 --> 00:27:56,360
Rank, wealth, glory...

565
00:27:57,880 --> 00:27:59,200
I do not want any of it.

566
00:28:00,280 --> 00:28:01,680
Let us go back to Shazhou.

567
00:28:03,760 --> 00:28:05,920
I only want you standing safely before me.

568
00:28:09,080 --> 00:28:10,120
Please.

569
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:13,120
Do not leave me.

570
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:17,920
Please.

571
00:28:21,800 --> 00:28:23,240
Please...

572
00:28:23,320 --> 00:28:25,200
I heard Jiang Mei'er came
looking for trouble again.

573
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:26,520
Does she really think we are easy targets?

574
00:28:26,600 --> 00:28:29,280
I'll avenge you
by bashing her with an abacus.

575
00:28:29,360 --> 00:28:32,000
But to me, nothing is worth
risking your life for.

576
00:28:32,560 --> 00:28:33,600
Let us make our way in the capital.

577
00:28:34,440 --> 00:28:35,760
You open a tavern,

578
00:28:35,840 --> 00:28:36,800
and I will sit the imperial examination.

579
00:28:36,880 --> 00:28:40,240
-Together, we'll make our mark.
-Capital, here we come!

580
00:28:40,320 --> 00:28:42,440
Here we come!

581
00:28:42,520 --> 00:28:43,520
I got this at Lingquan Temple

582
00:28:43,600 --> 00:28:44,720
especially for you. It
is the best fortune lot.

583
00:28:44,800 --> 00:28:47,240
The monk said you are certain
to pass the imperial examination.

584
00:28:47,320 --> 00:28:48,240
May my writing earn me
a place in government,

585
00:28:49,720 --> 00:28:50,800
change my fate,

586
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:54,200
and let me protect those dearest to me.

587
00:29:02,200 --> 00:29:04,800
I have tried so hard.

588
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:06,640
I really have tried so hard.

589
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:10,000
Mengmeng.

590
00:29:10,080 --> 00:29:11,440
I know.

591
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,640
I have seen it all.

592
00:29:14,760 --> 00:29:15,920
Even if you fail the examination,

593
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:18,960
you will still be the finest
Meng Tinghui in the world.

594
00:29:19,040 --> 00:29:21,360
There is only one Meng Tinghui like you.

595
00:29:21,440 --> 00:29:22,280
Fuzhi.

596
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:24,040
I became the top scholar!

597
00:29:24,120 --> 00:29:25,640
The top scholar!

598
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:30,360
Mengmeng is right here.

599
00:29:30,440 --> 00:29:31,320
Look.

600
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:32,800
Brilliant beyond measure.

601
00:29:32,880 --> 00:29:34,560
You have everything anyone could want.

602
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:36,440
You are so heartless.

603
00:29:36,520 --> 00:29:38,680
We promised to return to Shazhou together.

604
00:29:38,760 --> 00:29:40,160
You broke your promise.

605
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,600
You have to promise me

606
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:43,520
that when you shelter
others from the rain,

607
00:29:43,600 --> 00:29:45,000
you will protect yourself first.

608
00:29:47,360 --> 00:29:48,480
Stop!

609
00:29:49,280 --> 00:29:50,320
Stop feeding her!

610
00:29:51,120 --> 00:29:52,120
Stop!

611
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:53,920
Let her go!

612
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:03,040
Please, give me an Infinity Pill.

613
00:31:04,880 --> 00:31:06,320
I will do anything you ask.

614
00:31:08,040 --> 00:31:09,480
Anything at all.

615
00:31:13,360 --> 00:31:14,480
What if I told you

616
00:31:14,560 --> 00:31:16,280
to kill Meng Tinghui?

617
00:31:16,360 --> 00:31:18,840
Fine. I will kill her.

618
00:31:18,920 --> 00:31:20,160
I will kill her.

619
00:31:21,720 --> 00:31:24,120
Fuzhi!

620
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:25,160
Wake up!

621
00:31:36,320 --> 00:31:37,680
Proprietor Yan.

622
00:31:37,760 --> 00:31:38,960
This is Lord Meng.

623
00:31:39,720 --> 00:31:41,640
Let go!

624
00:31:44,080 --> 00:31:45,040
My lord, are you all right?

625
00:31:46,680 --> 00:31:47,720
I am here.

626
00:31:47,800 --> 00:31:49,600
Mengmeng.

627
00:31:49,680 --> 00:31:50,640
It hurts so much.

628
00:31:51,360 --> 00:31:53,680
It feels like bugs are
gnawing all over me.

629
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:57,480
Please kill me.

630
00:31:57,560 --> 00:31:58,400
There are bugs.

631
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:00,680
They are biting me.

632
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:02,480
They are gnawing at my bones.

633
00:32:02,560 --> 00:32:03,560
I cannot bear it.

634
00:32:03,640 --> 00:32:05,400
Yinqing, quickly!

635
00:32:07,360 --> 00:32:08,200
Careful.

636
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:10,600
Slowly.

637
00:32:12,080 --> 00:32:13,360
Fuzhi, slowly.

638
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:29,240
Mengmeng.

639
00:32:30,320 --> 00:32:32,040
Kill me.

640
00:32:32,120 --> 00:32:33,440
Please.

641
00:32:34,520 --> 00:32:35,720
If you die,

642
00:32:37,440 --> 00:32:38,760
what am I supposed to do?

643
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:42,720
If anything happens to you,

644
00:32:44,600 --> 00:32:46,200
I will not go on living either.

645
00:32:59,080 --> 00:32:59,960
I have an Infinity Pill here.

646
00:33:04,760 --> 00:33:05,800
Give it to me.

647
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:06,720
Give me the Infinity Pill!

648
00:33:06,800 --> 00:33:07,800
Fuzhi!

649
00:33:11,280 --> 00:33:12,120
Give it to me!

650
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:18,480
Shen Zhishu!

651
00:33:18,560 --> 00:33:20,080
Are you trying to make
her die even sooner?

652
00:33:20,160 --> 00:33:22,120
Do you want to watch her die in agony?

653
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:23,080
Meng Tinghui!

654
00:33:23,160 --> 00:33:24,520
You are supposed to be her closest friend.

655
00:33:24,600 --> 00:33:26,720
Can you not even let
her die with less pain?

656
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:30,240
She will not die.

657
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:33,920
She absolutely will not die.

658
00:33:39,320 --> 00:33:40,600
If she really...

659
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:46,440
If she really...

660
00:33:47,840 --> 00:33:49,520
then I will go with her.

661
00:33:53,800 --> 00:33:55,080
On the road to the afterlife,

662
00:33:55,600 --> 00:33:57,800
I will never let you be alone.

663
00:33:58,800 --> 00:33:59,840
I just...

664
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:02,280
do not want to see her suffer like this.

665
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:04,840
Lady Meng.

666
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:06,760
Huiyin House's caravans

667
00:34:06,840 --> 00:34:07,800
travel to the border year-round

668
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:09,120
to obtain these Ice Soul Pills.

669
00:34:09,200 --> 00:34:10,960
They counter the heat toxin
of Five-Stone Powder.

670
00:34:11,040 --> 00:34:13,000
-Fuzhi.
-It won't cure the Infinity Pill,

671
00:34:13,080 --> 00:34:14,280
but the two poisons are quite similar.

672
00:34:15,480 --> 00:34:16,560
With her life hanging in the balance,

673
00:34:16,640 --> 00:34:19,040
I hope this pill gives
you a chance to save her.

674
00:34:19,720 --> 00:34:21,920
My lord, it is not a perfect
match for her condition,

675
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:22,840
but it is worth trying.

676
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:39,840
Fuzhi.

677
00:34:41,560 --> 00:34:43,000
If this road leads to death,

678
00:34:44,400 --> 00:34:45,760
I will walk it with you.

679
00:34:51,320 --> 00:34:52,640
-Fuzhi.
-Let me examine her.

680
00:34:52,720 --> 00:34:53,800
Fuzhi.

681
00:34:56,760 --> 00:34:57,640
Fuzhi.

682
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:00,520
Her pulse is faint as a thread,

683
00:35:01,040 --> 00:35:02,200
but it has not stopped.

684
00:35:03,640 --> 00:35:04,800
If by midnight tonight

685
00:35:04,880 --> 00:35:06,360
the heat toxin does not flare up again,

686
00:35:06,440 --> 00:35:07,920
she will have escaped death.

687
00:35:17,680 --> 00:35:20,000
We owe much to Lady Situ
for her generous help.

688
00:35:20,560 --> 00:35:21,600
Lady Yan and Lady Meng

689
00:35:21,680 --> 00:35:23,400
once treated me like a sister.

690
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:25,440
I am only doing what little I can.

691
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:28,040
Lady Yan's danger has not passed tonight.

692
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:30,000
I will take my leave

693
00:35:30,080 --> 00:35:31,360
so I do not disturb you all.

694
00:35:32,080 --> 00:35:32,920
It is late.

695
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:34,040
I will see Mistress Situ out.

696
00:36:52,160 --> 00:36:53,080
Zhili.

697
00:36:53,160 --> 00:36:54,040
It is so late.

698
00:36:54,520 --> 00:36:55,560
Why are you still here?

699
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:10,320
Why are you crying?

700
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,320
Who bullied you?

701
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:14,440
I always thought

702
00:37:15,320 --> 00:37:16,640
there was nothing in this world

703
00:37:16,720 --> 00:37:18,200
that could frighten Lady Meng.

704
00:37:18,280 --> 00:37:21,040
But when Lady Yan's
addiction seized her today,

705
00:37:21,120 --> 00:37:23,160
Lord Meng wept her heart out.

706
00:37:23,240 --> 00:37:24,680
Even my brother cried.

707
00:37:26,040 --> 00:37:26,880
A Nian.

708
00:37:27,440 --> 00:37:28,800
I am scared.

709
00:37:28,880 --> 00:37:31,360
I am afraid Lady Yan may never wake up.

710
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:33,320
And I am even more afraid
something might happen to you.

711
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:38,280
Zhili.

712
00:37:38,360 --> 00:37:39,640
I am back, am I not?

713
00:37:40,360 --> 00:37:41,200
I am fine.

714
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:45,760
You are getting bolder and bolder.

715
00:37:45,840 --> 00:37:47,880
Before sunset, Guard Huang
led the Light Cavalry

716
00:37:47,960 --> 00:37:49,480
and the Divine Guard back
to the capital to report.

717
00:37:49,560 --> 00:37:51,000
Yet you dared act alone

718
00:37:51,080 --> 00:37:52,120
and stayed away all night.

719
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:53,440
What if something had happened to you?

720
00:37:54,000 --> 00:37:55,160
Zhili.

721
00:37:55,720 --> 00:37:56,920
Does your hand hurt?

722
00:37:58,520 --> 00:37:59,760
I am back, am I not?

723
00:37:59,840 --> 00:38:01,840
Why do you make me worry so much?

724
00:38:02,360 --> 00:38:03,560
And you are still calling me Zhili?

725
00:38:03,640 --> 00:38:04,920
Do you think that because
you are grown now,

726
00:38:05,000 --> 00:38:06,320
you no longer have to listen to me?

727
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:07,560
Call me Sister.

728
00:38:08,680 --> 00:38:09,520
Sister.

729
00:38:13,360 --> 00:38:14,520
Do not try to look pitiful now.

730
00:38:20,640 --> 00:38:21,640
Are you hurt?

731
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:44,760
I have never seen

732
00:38:44,840 --> 00:38:46,360
my brother look that worried before.

733
00:38:47,760 --> 00:38:49,880
He actually fell for Lady Yan long ago.

734
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:52,400
He has simply kept denying his feelings

735
00:38:52,480 --> 00:38:53,680
and refused to admit them.

736
00:38:54,520 --> 00:38:56,560
With Lady Yan in this condition,

737
00:38:56,640 --> 00:38:57,760
of course his heart is breaking.

738
00:38:58,720 --> 00:39:00,840
I hope Lady Yan makes it through tonight.

739
00:39:02,160 --> 00:39:03,680
If anything happens to her,

740
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:05,800
that little light in my brother's eyes

741
00:39:06,360 --> 00:39:07,760
may go out forever.

742
00:39:07,840 --> 00:39:09,760
Lord Meng's whole world
would collapse too.

743
00:39:12,240 --> 00:39:14,120
I will bring Ling Yunfei to justice.

744
00:39:17,520 --> 00:39:18,880
I hope Lady Yan

745
00:39:18,960 --> 00:39:20,280
will be protected by Heaven.

746
00:39:22,160 --> 00:39:23,120
Look at you.

747
00:39:23,200 --> 00:39:25,000
How did you get hurt this badly?

748
00:39:25,080 --> 00:39:27,040
While searching for the valley
outside the capital,

749
00:39:27,120 --> 00:39:28,280
I got scratched by accident.

750
00:39:28,360 --> 00:39:29,360
It was a long journey,

751
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:30,800
so I returned a little late.

752
00:39:30,880 --> 00:39:32,560
Did you find anything outside the capital?

753
00:39:32,640 --> 00:39:33,760
We still need more time.

754
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:36,080
There was no word from you
for a day and a night,

755
00:39:36,160 --> 00:39:37,480
and then you came back covered in wounds.

756
00:39:37,560 --> 00:39:38,960
Do you know how worried I was?

757
00:39:41,920 --> 00:39:42,760
What are you smiling at?

758
00:39:43,320 --> 00:39:44,520
You care about me.

759
00:39:46,240 --> 00:39:47,960
When have I ever not cared about you?

760
00:39:51,280 --> 00:39:53,000
You should visit a clinic tomorrow.

761
00:39:53,080 --> 00:39:53,920
I know.

762
00:40:05,360 --> 00:40:06,400
What is this?

763
00:40:06,920 --> 00:40:09,280
I found it while searching for the valley
outside the capital.

764
00:40:09,360 --> 00:40:10,480
I heard that carrying it

765
00:40:10,560 --> 00:40:11,400
brings good luck.

766
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:14,040
It looks like you are the one
who needs some good luck.

767
00:40:19,880 --> 00:40:20,840
Rest and let your wounds heal.

768
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:22,040
I am going to see Lady Yan.

769
00:40:27,640 --> 00:40:28,880
I will go with you.

770
00:40:29,440 --> 00:40:30,480
You stay here and rest.

771
00:40:30,560 --> 00:40:31,480
Go home early.

772
00:40:48,080 --> 00:40:48,920
Shopkeeper.

773
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:52,800
I wonder how Proprietor Yan is doing.

774
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:54,360
Shopkeeper,

775
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:56,840
you may compete fiercely in business
with Proprietor Yan,

776
00:40:56,920 --> 00:40:58,240
but you really do care about her.

777
00:40:59,280 --> 00:41:00,360
Business is business.

778
00:41:00,440 --> 00:41:03,120
But you saw how terrifying
people on the Infinity Pill can become.

779
00:41:03,200 --> 00:41:05,160
Master Zhao and Old Madam Zhao

780
00:41:05,240 --> 00:41:06,680
are both gone now.

781
00:41:09,440 --> 00:41:10,760
Proprietor Yan is a woman

782
00:41:10,840 --> 00:41:12,320
making her way in the world alone
is not easy.

783
00:41:13,040 --> 00:41:14,200
Fortunately, Lord Meng was there this time

784
00:41:14,280 --> 00:41:15,280
and managed to save her.
